OL,3,A'I have fired 40 of my agents for being
OL,4,Acorrupt', says Nigeria's
OL,5,Aanti-corruption chief
OL,6,
OL,7,FNigeria's anti-corruption agency has
OL,8,Fdismissed more than 40 employees for
OL,9,Falleged corruption and financial
OL,10,Fmisconduct over the past three years.
OL,12,FThe disclosure was made by Economic and
OL,13,FFinancial Crimes Commission (EFCC)
OL,14,Fchairman Ola Olukoyede at an event
OL,15,Fassessing the agency's achievements
OL,16,Fsince he took the helm in October 2023.
OL,18,FHe said more than five of the dismissed
OL,19,Fofficials were already facing
OL,20,Fprosecution, while case files are being
OL,21,Fprepared against others.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
