OL,3,A'I have fired 40 of my agents for being
OL,4,Acorrupt', says Nigeria's
OL,5,Aanti-corruption chief
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe EFCC investigates financial crimes,
OL,8,Fincluding fraud, money laundering and
OL,9,Fcorruption - regularly pursuing cases
OL,10,Fagainst politicians, public officials,
OL,11,Fbusiness figures and others accused of
OL,12,Fmisusing public funds.
